ns built with Pressable"},"76":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-21","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#default","content":"Use an Avatar with a one- or two-character monogram when no image is available."},"77":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-22","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#image","content":"Place Image before Text so the monogram is available while the image loads or if it fails."},"78":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-23","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#image-fallback","content":"Include a Text fallback so an unavailable photo never leaves an empty identity marker."},"79":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-24","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#shapes-and-sizes","content":"Use circular Avatars for people and square Avatars for organizations, workspaces, and accounts."},"80":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-25","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#emphasis","content":"Use primary or subtle for standard treatments, and a deterministic figure emphasis to categorize entities in a list."},"81":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-26","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#avatar-button","content":"Use `Pressable` to add accessible interaction to an Avatar while preserving its shape."},"82":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-27","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#account-menu","content":"Wrap an Avatar in a Pressable inside MenuTrigger for an account or profile menu."},"83":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-28","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#customization","content":"Use Image native image props for responsive image sources. Choose a deterministic