omponents:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1574,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1573,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1630,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[594,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1571,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[596,"**DOM Output:**"],[1484,"**End**"],[541,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[612,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[600,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[585,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[533,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1178,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[588,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1589,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1601,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1482,"**Home**"],[1604,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1593,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1779,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1770,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-