on and disabled state"],[1177,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1419,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[829,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1627,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1569,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1603,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1578,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[591,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1265,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1262,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1271,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1272,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1260,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1266,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1269,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1263,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1275,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[150,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1824,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1826,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1820,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1822,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1827,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1823,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1821,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1825,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1777,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[488,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1026,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1150,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[346,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[242,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1027,"`aria-disabled` 